{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"first-principles","title":"Tesla 第一性原理文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/first-principles","wordCount":2028,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"extreme-manufacturing","title":"Tesla 极限制造文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/extreme-manufacturing","wordCount":2415,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"mission-driven","title":"Tesla 使命驱动组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/mission-driven","wordCount":2466,"readingTime":10},{"seq":4,"slug":"elon-musk-leadership","title":"马斯克的领导风格：极限压力管理与工程决策直接介入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/elon-musk-leadership","wordCount":2630,"readingTime":11},{"seq":5,"slug":"mission-vision-evolution","title":"特斯拉使命愿景价值观的演变：从 Master Plan 到 Amazing Abundance","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/mission-vision-evolution","wordCount":2300,"readingTime":10},{"seq":6,"slug":"hardcore-culture","title":"\"Hardcore\"文化解析：极端工作强度与高淘汰高回报机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/hardcore-culture","wordCount":2383,"readingTime":10},{"seq":7,"slug":"innovation-speed-culture","title":"极速创新文化：快速迭代、接受失败与消灭官僚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/tesla/culture-and-values/innovation-speed-culture","wordCount":3133,"readingTime":13}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文化与价值观-简介\">文化与价值观 简介</h1><p>Tesla 的企业文化建立在三个支柱之上：第一性原理的思维方式、极限制造的工程信仰、以及使命驱动的组织凝聚力。这三者相互强化，构成了 Tesla 区别于所有传统车企的文化基因。</p>\n<p><strong>第一性原理文化</strong>探讨 Musk 如何将物理学思维方式植入组织决策——不接受&quot;行业惯例&quot;作为答案，而是回到基本物理定律重新推导最优解。这种思维方式在电池成本、制造工艺、供应链设计等领域产生了颠覆性创新。</p>\n<p><strong>极限制造文化</strong>记录 Tesla 从&quot;生产地狱&quot;中锻造出的制造哲学。Model 3 产能爬坡期间的帐篷产线、Musk 亲自睡在工厂的故事，不仅是创业传奇，更塑造了&quot;制造即创新&quot;的组织信念。</p>\n<p><strong>使命驱动组织</strong>分析&quot;加速世界向可持续能源转型&quot;这一使命如何成为组织运转的核心动力，以及当使命与利润发生冲突时 Tesla 的选择逻辑。</p>\n<p>本章为理解后续章节提供文化语境——Tesla 的绩效制度、组织设计和战略选择，都根植于这些文化基因之中。</p>\n"}